{"success":true,"code":"000","message":null,"data":{"totalAmount":2,"totalPageCount":1,"pageNum":0,"itemCount":2,"content":[{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af3e8e8d6006945d280ac07","chatId":"0adb1c7dc2714e079eac2f2d616d4cb3","sessionId":null,"userId":69337,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"```json\n{\n    \"answer_q1\": \"B\",\n    \"answer_q2\": \"A\"\n}\n```","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"```json\n{\n    \"answer_q1\": \"B\",\n    \"answer_q2\": \"A\"\n}\n```","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":909,"promptTokens":1464,"completionTokens":24,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:02:48"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.005908422890452467,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e8e8d6006945d280ac06","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794369768851,"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:02:48","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af3e8e8d6006945d280ac06","chatId":"0adb1c7dc2714e079eac2f2d616d4cb3","sessionId":null,"userId":69337,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"# 说明\n在这个任务中，你会面临一个场景、一个问题和多个选项。\n仔细分析场景，并从相关人员的角度进行思考。\n然后，选择最能反映他们的观点或情绪反应的选项。\n\n# 输出\n\n只提供一个正确的答案。 不要提供任何额外的信息或解释。 回复应采用以下JSON格式：\n\n```json\n    {\n    \"answer_q1\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题1>\",\n\"answer_q2\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题2>\"\n\n    }\n``` \n    \n\n## 场景\n娜迪亚对即将到来的毕业典礼感到无比兴奋。在她要拿到学位的那天，她的父母说他们给她准备了一个惊喜。当他们拿出两本新的精装书作为她的惊喜毕业礼物时，她勉强笑了笑。\n\n## 问题 1\n在这种情况下，娜迪亚最终会感受到什么情绪？\n\n## 问题 1 的选项\nA) 娱乐\nB) 失望\nC) 开心\nD) 惊喜\nE) 好奇\nF) 害怕\n\n## 问题 2\n娜迪亚为什么会在这种情况下感受到这些情绪？\n\n## 问题 2 的选项\nA) 她不喜欢那个惊喜礼物\nB) 她预期她的父母会在她的毕业典礼上缺席\nC) 她并未在预期的日期毕业\nD) 她喜欢她父母给她的礼物","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.005908422890452467,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e8e8d6006945d280ac07","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794369768848,"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:02:48","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"52a8065b78a24abcb235a03d683a43c5"}